			"widgets_values":[
				"**Video Storyboard Script (5 Seconds)**\n\n**Scene 1 (0-1 second):**  \n- **Environment:** The scene opens with a wide-angle shot of a futuristic urban setting under heavy rainfall. Neon grids of orange-red and cyan-blue lights dominate the background, casting vibrant reflections on the wet tiled floor.  \n- **Light:** The lighting is a mix of soft neon glow and hard rain reflections, creating a high-contrast, saturated aesthetic.  \n- **Composition:** Center composition, with the young woman seated prominently in the frame, robe spread dramatically around her.  \n- **Camera Movement:** Slow zoom-in from a medium-wide shot to a medium-close shot, emphasizing her figure and the texture of the robe.  \n\n**Scene 2 (1-3 seconds):**  \n- **Environment:** The camera shifts to a medium-close shot, focusing on the woman’s upper body. Her wet hair clings to her skin, and water droplets shimmer on her chest and the satin fabric. The neon grids behind her create a dynamic geometric backdrop.  \n- **Light:** High contrast with neon side lighting (red on one side, cyan on the other), accentuating the wet textures and folds of the robe.  \n- **Emotion:** She tilts her head slightly, gazing directly at the camera with an intense and alluring expression.  \n- **Camera Movement:** The lens slowly pans upward, following her gaze while maintaining focus on the details of her robe and skin.  \n\n**Scene 3 (3-5 seconds):**  \n- **Environment:** The shot transitions to a dramatic close-up of her chest and robe, highlighting the interplay of water droplets, satin sheen, and neon reflections. Rain streaks continue to fall in the foreground, adding depth and motion.  \n- **Light:** Side lighting shifts to edge lighting, creating a glowing rim effect around her shoulders and robe edges.  \n- **Camera Movement:** A slow tilt upward reveals her neck and jawline, ending with a slight rack focus to the neon grids behind her, creating a sense of mystery and futurism.  \n- **Mood:** The scene fades to black, leaving a lingering sense of sensuality and dystopian allure.\n\n---\n\n**English Prompt for AI Generation:**  \n\"Cyberpunk cinematic scene, futuristic urban environment with heavy rainfall, glowing neon orange-red and cyan-blue grids casting reflections on wet tiled surfaces. A young woman with dark wet hair, wearing an open red satin robe, sitting dramatically in the center. High contrast lighting with saturated colors, side lighting and edge lighting emphasizing water droplets and fabric texture. Camera movements include slow zoom, upward tilt, and rack focus. Intense and alluring mood with dystopian mystery. Rendered in neon-noir style, 4K resolution, ultra-realistic textures, cinematic framing.\""
